{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"eb6345afd33687596b75bd3ec70eee77d05c005e5768bd4c7c2766472a50187d","ja":"勝負師のカン","zh":"赌徒的直觉","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"bbed66b68775b7bcfeed4e23a5f729af966f6c96e9253992d6c0772284b2b4c3","ja":"なぁ、最近の●●●●プロデューサー、\nなんか変だと思わないか？","zh":"喂，你不觉得最近的●●●●制作人\n有点奇怪吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c8ea7f30ebe1a620ada4cd748c583c70ab2da81bbe0178fc26dac59d7fcc3b2f","ja":"そうですか～？　……あっ、そういえば、\n今日は寝癖がついてたかも！","zh":"是吗～？……啊，这么说来，\n今天头型可能睡翘了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c3f4ce21b3e2d5fb0d7fc140e73f0a365f442ae86cc4010e55a7d5de9871895e","ja":"いや、そう言うんじゃなくてさ。なんか、\nアタシたちに隠し事をしてる気がするんだよな……。","zh":"不是，我不是那个意思。总觉得，\n她好像有什么事情瞒着我们……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b82a5f1247df80dc99d25828fa5a7ac6fa1e24376ab6a824e3de780ecca76251","ja":"隠し事、ですか？　今朝お話しした時には、\n特に気になったことはなかったですけど……。","zh":"有瞒着您的事，是吗？今天早上和她说话的时候，\n倒没有觉得有什么特别反常的地方就是了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"dd98e9eb502cee55dd1bd675e76f93c18f031f95014af6fa340186e9114f10d6","ja":"私もさっき会ったけど、いつもと変わらない\n普通デューサーさんだったよ？","zh":"我也刚刚才见过，还是和平常一样\n普通的制作人先生哦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3717a0c9c228129f9866c3616711fc59af7f9f59f13b6e960073566405a61fd2","ja":"アユムは、何か気になることがあったのですか？","zh":"步是有什么在意的事情吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"016e7720ab2a16225b9e2cede9d0b84f439305756333a6ca650289ce26bd1c8c","ja":"別にハッキリ何かあったってワケじゃないんだけど……\nほら、この前までリイチの演技をしてただろ？","zh":"倒也不是明确发生了什么事……\n你看，之前不是一直在演理一吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"e5f1fa6498a53ec1ec11ff8e9b4ae0f529064f72bfdc39d01d025a18981163ee","ja":"その緊張感が残ってるせいか、\n勝負師のカンみたいなのが冴えてるんだ。","zh":"可能是因为还残留着那种紧张感吧，\n像胜负师一样的直觉特别敏锐呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"dad734374b4533276e88365e89427b5f545f9562554d40610f241308bd40db65","ja":"信号が変わるタイミングが分かるとかさ。","zh":"比如能知道红绿灯变换的时机什么的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a2e470351370a7ae7466fb291c32f254a9c7c02c21eb4c50e29f585287c58a0c","ja":"それって、\nたまたまなんじゃないんですか～？","zh":"那不过是\n偶然吧～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"c3d57e849199cd7a7cd59b114387c561a0c31cb33e16e7caba2582b780dfa99b","ja":"いや……今のアタシのカンには自信がある！\nだからきっと、何かあるはずなんだ！","zh":"不……我对现在的直觉很有自信！\n所以肯定会有什么才对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"8253d4f9ee335bf2827b4212f80ee9531f15baf4f316fd65c90b4c715682be30","ja":"でも、●●●●プロデューサーさんが\n隠さなきゃいけないことってなんでしょう？","zh":"不过，●●●●制作人必须隐瞒的事情\n会是什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"85ddf342af0c20f7d3825159c93ac652a79972d20826f6d5097317a5c23774ac","ja":"う～ん、なんだろうね……。","zh":"嗯～，是什么呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"2e75e8a01b57a490272c6fa9ed52d00ddb6ea5fc7bb3ec40e721b71a2909c003","ja":"……あれ？　●●●●プロデューサーさんから電話だ。\nちょっと出てくるね。","zh":"……咦？是●●●●制作人打来的电话。\n我去接一下哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"d37c2e90e1b7fd79013e1195d39c3661de057fc84fa6ca9530b4a5b1fea050e2","ja":"今の電話……\n何かタイミングが良すぎないか？","zh":"刚才那通电话……\n是不是来得有点太巧了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"2cddf4478ce5eba2bda7d6597ec6d50c3cdcdcd41d8715d697d3c2619b9410b6","ja":"気にしすぎですよ～。映画じゃないんですから、\nそんな変なことは起きないですって。","zh":"你想太多啦～。又不是在拍电影，\n才不会发生那种怪事呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1317.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"5849ac943f562f5c1254b0a69a43e313ea76633f80f4e72fe274bbe244fbe45b","ja":"そうかもしんないけどさぁ、\nなーんか引っかかってるんだよな……。","zh":"虽然可能确实是这样，\n但总觉得有哪里挂在心上啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
